### emit_expr

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl emit_expr forall a t. (args : a) (code : string) : t =\n    real\n        $'Fable.Core.JsInterop.emitJsExpr !args !code ' : t","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
